      "content": "look i get the risks but im just looking for a way to optimize this. i've read online that some people use moderate amounts of caffeine to actually enhance the effects of ADHD meds without it being a huge deal. if i stick to like one coffee in the morning and then just use the ritalin like usual, is that actually going to hurt me, or are you just being extra cautious? i really need to know if there's a way to make this work safely so i don't fail these exams.",
